fe-citations"},"children":["法定职业病自 2025 年 8 月 1 日起是 12 大类 135 种，其中含 4 项开放性条款。排在第一类的是职业性尘肺病。里面有矽肺、煤工尘肺、石墨尘肺、碳黑尘肺、石棉肺、滑石尘肺。还有水泥尘肺、云母尘肺、陶工尘肺、铝尘肺、电焊工尘肺、铸工尘肺，再加一项开放条款。职业性耳鼻喉口腔疾病里有噪声聋和爆震聋。职业性眼病里有化学性眼部灼伤和电光性眼炎。其中尘肺和噪声聋的损伤是永久的。美国国家职业安全卫生研究所（NIOSH）说，矽肺是永久的肺损伤，会逐渐加重，目前没有已知的治愈办法。一篇柳叶刀综述说，病人不再接触粉尘以后，肺功能仍会随病情进展变差。美国职业安全与健康管理局（OSHA）说，噪声造成的听力损失是永久的，手术和药物都纠正不了。法律给了四条可以当场搬出来用的权利。一是知道这个工作场所里有哪些职业病危害、会造成什么后果、该采取哪些防护措施。二是要求单位提供合格的防护设施和个人防护用品、改善工作条件。三是对违反职业病防治法律法规的做法、以及会危及生命健康的做法提出批评、检举和控告。四是「拒绝违章指挥和强令进行没有职业病防护措施的作业」，不合规的指挥和没有防护的活，你可以不干。并且「因劳动者依法行使正当权利而降低其工资、福利等待遇或者解除、终止与其订立的劳动合同的，其行为无效」。因为你用了这几条权利就给你降薪、降待遇或者辞退你，这些做法不算数（全国）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国家卫生健康委、人力资源社会保障部、国家疾控局、全国总工会 (2024). 职业病分类和目录（2025 年 8 月 1 日起实施）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202412/content_6992843.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202412/content_6992843.htm"]},"；新版目录 12 大类 135 种的口径见国家卫生健康委 (2024). 新版目录将职业病调整为 12 大类 135 种. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/lianbo/bumen/202412/content_6992838.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/lianbo/bumen/202412/content_6992838.htm"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2018). 职业病防治法（第三十九条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.beijing.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengcefagui/qtwj/201711/t20171104_779851.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.beijing.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengcefagui/qtwj/201711/t20171104_779851.html"]},"（北京市人民政府转载）；National Institute for Occupational Safety and Health (2026). Silica Symptoms and Medical Monitoring：「permanent lung damage called silicosis. It is a progressive, debilitating, and sometimes fatal disease」「There is no known cure for silicosis」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cdc.gov/niosh/silica/symptoms/index.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cdc.gov/niosh/silica/symptoms/index.html"]},"；Leung CC, Yu IT, Chen W (2012). Silicosis. Lancet, 379(9830), 2008-2018：「Impairment of lung function increases with disease progression, even after the patient is no longer exposed」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(12)60235-9","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(12)60235-9"]},"；Occupational Safety and Health Administration. Occupational Noise Exposure：「permanent hearing loss that cannot be corrected through surgery or with medicine」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.osha.gov/noise","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.osha.gov/noise"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["口罩要认对，粉尘岗位要戴防颗粒物口罩，这是作者经验。噪声岗位单位不发耳塞就自己买，几元一副，听力掉了补不回来。「干两年攒够钱就走」在尘肺上不成立。矽肺在不再接触粉尘以后还会继续加重。所以离岗体检格外重要（见第 9 条，三次职业健康检查由单位安排并掏钱）。新版目录还新增了两类。一类是职业性肌肉骨骼疾病，里面是腕管综合征，只限长时间重复用手腕或者用力干活的制造业工人。另一类是职业性精神和行为障碍，里面是创伤后应激障碍。它只限参与突发事件处置的人民警察、医疗卫生人员、消防救援等应急救援人员。化学品溅到身上的现场处理见第 13 节第 21 条。创伤后应激障碍怎么治，见第 29 节第 14 条（创伤聚焦的心理治疗）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/19-09"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"进有粉尘、噪声、化学品的岗位之前，先看合同里写没写危害；三次职业健康检查由单位安排并掏钱"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/19-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"上班受伤、上下班路上被撞，第一件事是做工伤认定，单位不报你自己报"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/19-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["公司违法解除的，赔偿金是经济补偿标准的二倍"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["公司属于违法解除的，赔偿金按经济补偿的标准翻倍，就是常说的 2N。是不是违法解除要看具体情形。先找法律援助或者律师问清楚，再决定是跟公司谈，还是去仲裁。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/19-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要签「个人原因主动辞职」，那一签就没有 N 了"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["签字承认「个人原因主动辞职」，经济补偿和失业保险金通常一起落空。自己提出离职，本来就不在给补偿的那几种情形里，公司欠薪、不缴社保这类过错除外。不必当天签，冷静一…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/19-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["离职前把工资条、考勤、劳动合同、社保记录和聊天记录先存下来"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["辞退、扣工资这类争议由单位举证，但加班要你先证明，单位的工资记录也只需要留两年。电脑和账号一交回去，这些材料就拿不到了。手里有工资条、考勤、社保记录和聊天原始记…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/19-12"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["别信「撑到工位就算工伤」：突发不适先打 120，不是先赶去打卡"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["突发不适往公司赶，不会让你多拿一笔钱。视同工伤要求人在工作时间、又在工作岗位上发病，路上发病没到岗的本来就不算。抢救超过 48 小时的反而也不算。为了凑条件耽误…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/19-13"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["单位没给你交工伤保险，工伤待遇一样有，由单位按同样的标准全额出"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["单位没给你交工伤保险，工伤待遇一样有。只是改成由单位按同样的项目和标准全额付，一分不少。没参保是对单位加罚：责令补缴、按日加收万分之五滞纳金，逾期还要罚欠缴额的…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/19-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["伤情稳定后去做劳动能力鉴定，伤残等级直接换算成钱"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["伤情稳定之后去做劳动能力鉴定，等级直接换算成钱。一次性伤残补助金按本人工资算，五级 18 个月、六级 16 个月、七级 13 个月。八级 11 个月、九级 9…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/19"},"children":["阅读整个主题：在职、离职和工伤 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/200